| Setup for !Freeciv and !CivServer: modules and paths that both the
| client and the server need. Run by both !Run files.

| --- Runtime support -------------------------------------------------
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Freeciv needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error Freeciv needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| PThreadTicker (from riscos-unixlib) runs UnixLib's thread switcher, so it
| is always paged in, whichever task is. A copy in !System is used if it's
| newer; without the module the programs run the same code from the RMA.
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 IfThere System:Modules.PThrTicker Then RMLoad System:Modules.PThrTicker
RMEnsure PThreadTicker 0.01 RMLoad <Freeciv$Dir>.PThrTicker

| --- Files ------------------------------------------------------------
| Paths handed to the programs are UnixLib paths of the form /<Var$Dir>/...
| Set expands <variables>, so they are written /|<Var$Dir>/... here: "|<"
| keeps the "<", and UnixLib expands the variable when a file is opened.
| Client options, saved games and extra data go in <Choices$Write>.Freeciv.
CDir <Choices$Write>.Freeciv
Set FREECIV_DATA_PATH /|<Freeciv$Dir>/data:/|<Choices$Write>/Freeciv/3.2
Set FREECIV_SCENARIO_PATH /|<Freeciv$Dir>/data/scenarios:/|<Choices$Write>/Freeciv/scenarios
Set FREECIV_LOCAL_ENCODING UTF-8
